ilable\nOSI status: _none_\n\n**Comment**\nNo comment; just opinions.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2902401176/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919951908","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2659#issuecomment-2919951908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2659","id":2919951908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86uCu4k","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T16:34:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T16:39:51Z","body":"Taking a look at this one in light of the [SPDX license inclusion guidelines](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md):\n\nAlthough some of this language is hard to follow, the clear intent of this section:\n\n> 5. Neither the source code nor a binary form may be used in a manner that entirely or primarily derives from the value of the software or modified version, or offering a product or service that accomplishes for users the primary purpose of the source code.\n\n...appears intended to prohibit use of the software for some sort of commercial or service-providing purposes. I'm not clear on the intended full scope, but regardless, it's not going to be an \"open source-ish\" license for purposes of \"Other Factor 1\" in the guidelines.\n\nI'm not seeing any evidence of meaningful \"use in the wild\" by a large community, so this likely doesn't pass \"Other Factor 3\" either.\n\nFinally, I note that there does not appear to be a single stable license text for this one, e.g.:\n\n* the version submitted at https://tools.spdx.org/app/license_requests/425/ has 8 clauses but no disclaimer text at the end\n* the version at https://github.com/gms-electronics/GMS-Source-Available-License/blob/main/License.md has 8 clauses _and_ disclaimer text at the end\n* the version at https://github.com/gms-electronics/GMS-Source-Available-License/tree/main#detailed-license-explanation has 7 clauses and the disclaimer text\n\nGiven all of that, I am not in favor of adding this to the SPDX License List at this time.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919951908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919965455","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2659#issuecomment-2919965455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2659","id":2919965455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86uCyMP","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id"